  "content": "<div class=\"mwstitle section\">\n\n    <h1 property=\"name\" class=\"wb-inv\" id=\"wb-cont\" dir=\"ltr\">\nTransport and infrastructure</h1>\n\t</div>\n<div class=\"mwstext section\"><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\"><title>Untitled Document</title><div class=\"row profile\"> \n <div class=\"col-md-5\"> \n  <h1 property=\"name\" id=\"wb-cont\">Transport and infrastructure</h1> \n  <p class=\"pagetag\">Ensuring the safe movement of people and goods by air, rail, road and water. Funding for infrastructure projects. </p> \n  <section class=\"followus mrgn-bttm-md wb-init followus-inited\" id=\"wb-auto-4\"><h2> Follow: </h2> \n   <ul><li> <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/pages/Transport-Canada/401846167974\" class=\"facebook\" rel=\"external\"> <span class=\"wb-inv\"> Facebook </span> </a> </li> \n    <li> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/transport_gc\" class=\"twitter\" rel=\"external\"> <span class=\"wb-inv\"> X </span> </a> </li> \n    <li> <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/TransportCanada\" class=\"youtube\" rel=\"external\"> <span class=\"wb-inv\"> YouTube </span> </a> </li> \n    <li> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/TransportCanada\" class=\"instagram\" rel=\"external\"> <span class=\"wb-inv\"> Instagram </span> </a> </li> \n   </ul></section></div> \n <div class=\"col-md-7\"> \n  <h2 class=\"wb-inv\">Promotions</h2> \n  <div class=\"wb-tabs carousel-s2 playing wb-init wb-tabs-inited\" data-speed=\"slow\" id=\"wb-auto-5\"> \n   <ul role=\"tablist\" aria-live=\"off\"><li class=\"control prv\"><a class=\"prv\" role=\"button\" title=\"Previous\" href=\"javascript:;\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-chevron-left\"></span><span class=\"wb-inv\">Previous</span></a></li> <li class=\"control  tab-count\" tabindex=\"0\"><div>Item <div class=\"curr-count\"><span class=\"curr-index\">1</span> of 5</div></div></li><li class=\"control nxt\"><a class=\"nxt\" role=\"button\" title=\"Next\" href=\"javascript:;\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-chevron-right\"></span><span class=\"wb-inv\">Next</span></a></li>  \n    <li class=\"active\" role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"#tab1\" title=\"Tab 1\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"tab1\" id=\"tab1-lnk\"><img src=\"/content/dam/tc/images/carousel/oil-spill-carousel-thumbnail-1170x347.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a> </li> \n    <li role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"#tab2\" title=\"Tab 2\" tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"tab2\" id=\"tab2-lnk\"><img src=\"/content/dam/tc/images/carousel/zev-vze.png\" alt=\"\"></a> </li> \n    <li role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"#tab3\" title=\"Tab 3\" tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"tab3\" id=\"tab3-lnk\"><img src=\"/content/dam/tc/images/20-AA-09_DroneWebImages-THEME-Carousel-653X194.png\" alt=\"\"></a> </li> \n    <li role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"#tab4\" title=\"Tab 4\" tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"tab4\" id=\"tab4-lnk\"><img src=\"/content/dam/themes/transport/carousel/20180123-1.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a> </li> \n    <li role=\"presentation\"><a href=\"#tab5\" title=\"Tab 5\" tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"tab5\" id=\"tab5-lnk\"><img src=\"/content/dam/themes/transport/carousel/20161107-2.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a> </li> \n   <li class=\"control plypause\"><a class=\"plypause\" role=\"button\" title=\"Pause\" href=\"javascript:;\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-pause\"></span> <span>Pause</span><span class=\"wb-inv\">  -  Stop tab rotation</span></a></li> </ul><div class=\"tabpanels\"><div role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"tab1\" class=\"in fade\" aria-hidden=\"false\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"tab1-lnk\"> \n    <a href=\"https://letstalktransportation.ca/cssos?utm_campaign=tc-marine-liability-2020-09&amp;utm_medium=carousel&amp;utm_source=tci-themepage-en\" class=\"learnmore\"> \n     <figure><img src=\"/content/dam/tc/images/carousel/oil-spill-carousel-thumbnail-1170x347.jpg\" alt=\"\"><figcaption><p>Marine Liability and Compensation: Oil Spills</p> \n      </figcaption></figure></a> \n   </div><div role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"tab2\" class=\"out fade\" aria-hidden=\"true\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-labelledby=\"tab2-lnk\"> \n    <a href=\"https://tc.canada.ca/en/road-transportation/innovative-technologies/zero-emission-vehicles?utm_source=Carousel&amp;utm_medium=1&amp;utm_campaign=THEME-EN\" class=\"learnmore\"> \n     <figure><img src=\"/content/dam/tc/images/carousel/zev-vze.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption><p>Making zero-emission vehicles more affordable</p> \n      </figcaption></figure></a> \n   </div><div role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"tab3\" class=\"out fade\" aria-hidden=\"true\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-labelledby=\"tab3-lnk\"> \n    <a href=\"https://tc.canada.ca/en/aviation/drone-safety?utm_source=Carousel&amp;utm_medium=2&amp;utm_campaign=THEME-EN\" class=\"learnmore\"> \n     <figure><img src=\"/content/dam/tc/images/20-AA-09_DroneWebImages-THEME-Carousel-653X194.png\" alt=\"\"><figcaption><p>New drone rules in effect. Register your drone and get your pilot certificate!</p> \n      </figcaption></figure></a> \n   </div><div role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"tab4\" class=\"out fade\" aria-hidden=\"true\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-labelledby=\"tab4-lnk\"> \n    <a href=\"http://infc.gc.ca/04dd\" class=\"learnmore\"> \n     <figure><img src=\"/content/dam/themes/transport/carousel/20180123-1.jpg\" alt=\"\"><figcaption><p>Explore Investing in Canada plan projects in your community</p> \n      </figcaption></figure></a> \n   </div><div role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"tab5\" class=\"out fade\" aria-hidden=\"true\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-labelledby=\"tab5-lnk\"> \n    <a href=\"https://tc.canada.ca/en/campaigns/protecting-our-coasts-oceans-protection-plan\" class=\"learnmore\"> \n     <figure><img src=\"/content/dam/themes/transport/carousel/20161107-2.jpg\" alt=\"\"><figcaption><p>Learn more about how we are protecting our coasts</p> \n      </figcaption></figure></a> \n   </div></div> \n    \n    \n    \n    \n  </div> \n </div> \n</div> \n<div class=\"clearfix\"></div> \n \n \n<div class=\"row\"> \n <div class=\"col-md-4 col-xs-12 pull-right mrgn-tp-lg\"> \n  <section class=\"lnkbx well\"><h2 class=\"mrgn-tp-0\">Most requested</h2> \n   <ul class=\"lst-spcd\"><li><a href=\"https://tc.canada.ca/en/aviation/drone-safety\">Drone safety</a></li> \n    <li><a href=\"https://tc.canada.ca/en/aviation/aviation-security/what-not-bring-plane\">What not to bring on a plane</a></li> \n    <li><a href=\"https://tc.canada.ca/en/marine-transportation/vessel-licensing-registration\">Register your vessel</a></li> \n    <li><a href=\"https://tc.canada.ca/en/road-transportation/child-car-seat-safety\">Child car seat safety</a></li> \n    <li><a href=\"https://tc.canada.ca/en/corporate-services/acts-regulations/list-regulations/transportation-dangerous-goods-regulations\">Transporting dangerous goods - Regulations</a></li> \n    <li><a href=\"https://tc.canada.ca/en/corporate-services/acts-regulations/list-regulations/canadian-aviation-regulations-sor-96-433\"><cite>Canadian Aviation Regulations</cite></a></li> \n   </ul></section></div> \n <section class=\"col-md-8 pull-left\"><h2>Services and information</h2> \n  <div class=\"row\"> \n   <section class=\"col-md-6\"><h3 class=\"h5\"><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/transport/zero-emission-vehicles.html\">Zero-emission vehicles</a></h3> \n    <p>Purchase incentives, infrastructure funding, greening fleets, policies, regulations, alternative fueling stations.</p> \n   </section><section class=\"col-md-6\"><h3 class=\"h5\"><a href=\"https://tc.canada.ca/en/aviation\">Aviation</a></h3> \n    <p>Pilot and personnel licensing, aircraft and airport operations, drones, incident reporting, air travel, airworthiness. </p> \n   </section><section class=\"col-md-6\"><h3 class=\"h5\"><a href=\"https://tc.canada.ca/en/marine-transportation\">Marine transportation</a></h3> \n    <p>Licence, certify and register a vessel, safety and training, navigational aids, commercial vessels, pleasure craft. </p> \n   </section><section class=\"col-md-6\"><h3 class=\"h5\"><a href=\"https://tc.canada.ca/en/road-transportation\">Road transportation</a></h3> \n    <p>Defects and recalls, importing vehicles, child car seats, safety standards, commercial carriers, road security.</p> \n   </section><section class=\"col-md-6\"><h3 class=\"h5\"><a href=\"https://tc.canada.ca/en/rail-transportation\">Rail transportation</a></h3> \n    <p>Railway tracks, crossings and bridges, federal rail operations, safety/security investigations, actions and enforcement. </p> \n   </section><section class=\"col-md-6\"><h3 class=\"h5\"><a href=\"https://tc.canada.ca/en/dangerous-goods\">Dangerous goods</a></h3> \n    <p>Learn about the safe transport of dangerous goods in Canada by air, rail, road and water.</p> \n   </section><div class=\"clearfix\"></div> \n   <section class=\"col-md-6\"><h3 class=\"h5\"><a href=\"https://tc.canada.ca/en/infrastructure\">Infrastructure</a></h3> \n    <p>Funding programs for infrastructure projects. Federal investments in infrastructure by province and territory.</p> \n   </section></div> \n </section></div> \n<section class=\"gc-prtts\"><h2>Features</h2> \n <div class=\"row\"> \n  <section class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 mrgn-bttm-md\"><a href=\"https://tc.canada.ca/en/corporate-services/trade-transportation-corridors-initiative\" class=\"gl-priorities\"> <h3 class=\"h5 mrgn-bttm-lg\">Trade Transportation Corridors</h3> <img src=\"/content/dam/tc/images/features/20170704-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"img-responsive thumbnail mrgn-bttm-sm\"></a> \n   <p>Building stronger and more efficient transportation corridors to international markets to help Canadian businesses compete, grow and create more jobs.</p> \n  </section><section class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 mrgn-bttm-md\"><a href=\"https://tc.canada.ca/en/initiatives/transportation-2030-strategic-plan-future-transportation-canada\" class=\"gl-priorities\"> <h3 class=\"h5 mrgn-bttm-lg\">Transportation 2030</h3> <img src=\"/content/dam/themes/transport/features/20171011-1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"img-responsive  thumbnail mrgn-bttm-sm  col-md-12 col-lg-12\"></a> \n   <p>Transportation 2030: A strategic plan for the future of transportation in Canada</p> \n  </section><section class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 mrgn-bttm-md\"><a href=\"https://tc.canada.ca/en/road-transportation/defects-recalls-vehicles-tires-child-car-seats\" class=\"gl-priorities\"> <h3 class=\"h5\">Defects and recalls of vehicles, tires and child car seats</h3> <img src=\"/content/dam/tc/images/features/20150709-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"img-responsive thumbnail mrgn-bttm-sm\"></a> \n   <p>Check if your vehicle, tires or child car seat is subject to a recall, or report a safety defect!</p> \n  </section></div> \n</section><div class=\"clearfix\"></div></div>"
}